<title>USA: Jefferson Cty, Ky., won by JJB Hilliard.</title>
<headline>Jefferson Cty, Ky., won by JJB Hilliard.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>JJB Hilliard said it won $18.500 million of Jefferson Cty, Ky., governmental project lease revenue bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.3207 percent.</p>
